        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>FARA Registration Statement - Items 12-15 and Execution</title>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .stamp {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .stamp-bottom {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    margin: 30px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    border-top: 2px solid #000;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .section {\n    padding: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .num {\n    width: 45px;\n    flex: 0 0 45px;\n    padding-left: 6px;\n  }\n  .body {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 55px;\n  }\n  .cb {\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"DejaVu Sans\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .row3 {\n    display: flex;\n    margin: 12px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .row3 > div {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .fill {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n    min-width: 110px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .fill-long {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n    min-width: 200px;\n  }\n  .fill-short {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n    min-width: 75px;\n  }\n  .comp-line {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .comp-left {\n    flex: 0 0 55%;\n  }\n  .comp-right {\n    flex: 0 0 45%;\n  }\n  .col-headers {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n  .col-headers div:nth-child(1) { flex: 0 0 17%; }\n  .col-headers div:nth-child(2) { flex: 0 0 27%; }\n  .col-headers div:nth-child(3) { flex: 0 0 37%; }\n  .col-headers div:nth-child(4) { flex: 0 0 19%; text-align: right; }\n  .blank-space {\n    height: 260px;\n  }\n  .blank-space-small {\n    height: 190px;\n  }\n  .execution-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin: 22px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .exec-text {\n    margin-bottom: 50px;\n  }\n  .sig-row {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-left: 60px;\n    margin-bottom: 120px;\n  }\n  .sig-block {\n    flex: 0 0 42%;\n  }\n  .sig-line {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n    padding-left: 55px;\n  }\n  .sig-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-style: italic;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .sig-block.second {\n    flex: 0 0 45%;\n    margin-left: 6%;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .esigned {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -95px;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .footnote {\n    border-top: 1px solid #000;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"stamp\">Received by NSD/FARA Registration Unit&nbsp;&nbsp; 10/28/2016&nbsp;&nbsp; 1:42:39 PM</div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">12.</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">Do any of the above described services include political activity as defined in Section 1(o) of the Act and in the footnote below?</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n      <span style=\"margin-left:90px;\">Yes <span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span></span>\n      <span style=\"margin-left:100px;\">No <span class=\"cb\">&#9746;</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">If yes, describe separately and in detail such political activity.</div>\n    <div class=\"blank-space\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">13.</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">The services described in Items 11 and 12 are to be rendered on a</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row3\">\n      <div style=\"padding-left:110px;\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9746;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;full time basis</div>\n      <div><span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;part time basis</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:60px;\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;special basis</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">14.</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">What compensation or thing of value have you received to date or will you receive for the above services?</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n      <div class=\"comp-line\">\n        <div class=\"comp-left\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9746;</span>&nbsp; Salary: Amount $<span class=\"fill\">8,000</span> per <span class=\"fill\">month</span></div>\n        <div class=\"comp-right\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span>&nbsp; Commission at <span class=\"fill-short\"></span> % of <span class=\"fill-long\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comp-line\">\n        <div class=\"comp-left\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span>&nbsp; Salary: Not based solely on services rendered to the foreign principal(s).</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comp-line\">\n        <div class=\"comp-left\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span>&nbsp; Fee: Amount $<span class=\"fill\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"comp-right\"><span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span>&nbsp; Other thing of value <span class=\"fill-long\" style=\"min-width:280px;\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <div class=\"num\">15.</div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        During the period beginning 60 days prior to the date of your obligation to register to the time of filing this statement, did you make any contributions of money or other things of value from your own funds or possessions and on your own behalf in connection with any election to political office or in connection with any primary election, convention, or caucus held to select candidates for any political office?\n        <span style=\"margin-left:30px;\">Yes <span class=\"cb\">&#9744;</span></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left:30px;\">No <span class=\"cb\">&#9746;</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">If yes, furnish the following information:</div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-headers indent\">\n      <div>Date</div>\n      <div>Amount or Thing of Value</div>\n      <div>Political Organization or Candidate</div>\n      <div>Location of Event</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"blank-space_small\" style=\"height:290px;\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"execution-title\">EXECUTION</div>\n\n  <div class=\"exec-text\">\n    In accordance with 28 U.S.C. &sect; 1746, the undersigned swears or affirms under penalty of perjury that he/she has read the information set forth in this registration statement and that he/she is familiar with the contents thereof and that such contents are in their entirety true and accurate to the best of his/her knowledge and belief.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sig-row\">\n    <div class=\"sig-block\">\n      <div class=\"sig-line\">October 07, 2016</div>\n      <div class=\"sig-caption\">(Date of signature)</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sig-block second\">\n      <div class=\"sig-line\">/s/ Hirokazu Shimoda</div>\n      <div class=\"sig-caption\">(Signature)</div>\n      <div class=\"esigned\">eSigned</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"height:180px;\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"footnote\">\n    Footnote: \"Political activity,\" as defined in Section 1(o) of the Act, means any activity which the person engaging in believes will, or that the person intends to, in any way influence any agency or official of the Government of the United States or any section of the public within the United States with reference to formulating, adopting, or changing the domestic or foreign policies of the United States or with reference to the political or public interests, policies, or relations of a government of a foreign country or a foreign political party.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stamp-bottom\">Received by NSD/FARA Registration Unit&nbsp;&nbsp; 10/28/2016&nbsp;&nbsp; 1:42:39 PM</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
